# Binary assets (images, fonts, audio, video) allowed under public/ and src/. `npm run compliance` fails on any binary
# file there that is not listed, so new third-party or AI-generated assets cannot slip in unnoticed.
# One repo-relative path per line. Add a file here only after recording its source and licence in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
# Audio is deliberately absent: the game synthesizes its sound at runtime and ships no audio files.
#
# Generated by tools/make-favicon.mjs from the ASCII sprite map in that script (project-original pixel art):
public/apple-touch-icon.png
public/favicon.png
public/icon-192.png
public/icon-512.png
public/icon-maskable-512.png
public/og-image.png
